<title>UK: Hungary's Borsodchem sets up Polish firm.</title>
<headline>Hungary's Borsodchem sets up Polish firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian chemicals company Borsodchem Rt. said on Thursday it had set up a Polish company, Borsodchem - Polska Kft.</p>
<p>In a statement released in London, Borsodchem said the new company would be based in Katowice and would aim to further increase its market share in Poland. Business was expected to start in April.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
